flowchart LR
    ARXIV[arXiv query and category] --> PREVIEW[Preview exact selection]
    PREVIEW --> APPROVE{Approve prepared manifest?}
    APPROVE -->|No| STOP[No corpus changes]
    APPROVE -->|Yes| INGEST[Ingest prepared records]
    INGEST --> CAT[SQLite catalog and source snapshots]
    CAT --> INDEX[Explicit FTS5 index rebuild]
    INDEX --> FTS[Title and abstract passages]
    FTS --> SEARCH[Paper and passage search with collection filters]
    SEARCH --> SELECT[Select a paper identifier]
    CAT --> COLLECTIONS[Manage paper collections]
    COLLECTIONS -. Rebuild after catalog changes .-> INDEX
    SELECT --> CITE[Render citation from a stored observation]
    CAT --> CITE
    CITE --> EXPORT[BibTeX, Markdown, or CSL-JSON]

    subgraph STATUS[Experimental status]
        HUMAN[Human relevance review pending]
    end

    subgraph PLANNED[Planned features, not currently available]
        MCP[Read-only MCP]
        WATCH[Watchlists]
        TEXT[Full-text acquisition]
        ANALYSIS[LLM analysis]
        AUTHORS[Author identity enrichment]
        FEDERATION[Cross-corpus federation]
    end
